Hayvonlar turli joylarda yashaydi:
• jungle (tropik o‘rmon): monkey, parrot, snake;  • forest (o‘rmon): bear, fox, wolf, owl;
• desert (cho‘l): camel, lizard;  • sea / ocean (dengiz, okean): dolphin, whale, shark;
• savannah (savanna): lion, giraffe, zebra, elephant;  • Arctic (Arktika): polar bear.
Where do camels live? — They live in the desert. A giraffe has got a long neck.
